WEBVTT

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:03.620
Let's all aim for Divine Idolhood-pri!

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.230
Yes.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:05.760
Capisce!

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.240
Hello.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.250
Oh, Sophie!

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.950
What's up with your hair-pri?

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:18.400
I did it myself.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.120
The spikiness is adorable!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.300
You look so lovely, Lady Sophie!

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.410
Yes, yes.
Chanko!

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:28.710
It's all because I can be together with Lala and Mireille!

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.100
Sophie...

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.380
You heard her-pri.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.760
We're truly in your debt.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.850
Thanks to you-chanko!

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.960
We couldn't have protected Lady Sophie's smile if not for you.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.060
But...

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.770
Chanko!

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:46.730
Eh?

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:50.180
Should you ever cross Lady Sophie

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.010
we won't forgive you!

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.190
Chanko!

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.200
Pri...

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.490
Big news, everyone-kuma!

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:03.160
You're having a show all to yourselves thanks to your victory at the Idol Grand Prix!

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.620
Wow!

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.620
This is amazing!

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:09.250
That means we'll have to announce your team name in three days,

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.090
so get cracking-kumamama!

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:13.150
Team name?

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:15.290
And Lala, you need to come up with an autograph.

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:17.400
Oh, capisce!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.190
Sophie!

00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:00.230
Are you doing it yourself again?

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:02.350
I want to try doing stuff.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.290
I see...

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:07.900
You really have grown up a bit.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:10.250
But just looking at this is...

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:12.830
No, I mustn't!

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.060
Ohh... No!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.080
Ahh!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:21.990
All done!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.640
That's great!

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.110
I've seen the error of my ways.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:34.060
I was too hung up on thinking I had to always take care of everything for you.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:40.070
Sorry, no more overprotective big sister.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:43.100
But you still have my full cosmic support!

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.050
Thank you, Sister.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.380
What should we name our team?

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:53.700
I can smell them!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.790
Gah! The headmistress!

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:59.800
I can smell them! Smell, smell, oh?

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.550
How strange.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:09.420
I was certain I smelled PriTickets...

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:17.270
That was close.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:22.000
Sorry, I got delayed thanks to the headmistress.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.940
Rule #1115 of Paprika Academy:

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:29.020
Always show up 10 minutes early!

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.660
Your ticket number 192!

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:37.930
Only a few more till 200...

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:41.340
I'll finally see a real Golden Ticket soon.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.720
Golden... How lovely!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:48.190
Oh? Your hair looks even better than yesterday, Sophie.

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:50.790
Really? Thank you.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.680
Shows off the best part even more.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:55.920
We don't have time for idle chitchat!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:59.480
What about our team name?
And we've got practice right after school.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:00.900
Practice?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.090
Something the matter?

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.710
What's practice?

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:04.620
Huh?

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:09.150
Uh, err...  Practice is basically doing the same thing over and over again

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.800
until your singing and dancing and stuff is good enough, right?

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:12.640
Right.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:14.200
I've never done that.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.460
Allow us to explain!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:21.880
Lady Sophie, genius that she is,
has never had to do proper training!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.470
Yeah-chanko!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.910
She can instantly remember any song by just seeing the notation.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:32.350
And just by hearing the music, she can intuit the dance perfectly!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.060
Yeah-chanko!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.440
Oh yeah...

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.680
I appreciate Sophie's talent,

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:43.260
but isn't true genius about...

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:44.150
Head Disciplinarian?

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:48.580
...the ability to keep practicing?

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.970
Would that not be what true genius is ultimately about?

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:56.500
As such, I would like Sophie to join us for practice from now on.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:00.460
Huh? What right does an underclassman like you have to tell Lady Sophie what to do?

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.800
This isn't a question of age.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.010
We're a team now.

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:08.750
We have to work out positions for dancing,

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.620
and we must be able to take each other's habits into account on stage.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:14.470
This should be obvious to anyone aiming for Divine Idolhood.

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:15.920
How dare you?

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:18.190
Eh? Eh? What?

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:20.930
Practice.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.150
Sounds fun!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:26.350
But of course, Lady Sophie! Let's go to practice!

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:28.470
Practice is the best-chanko!

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:29.130
Yes.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:35.880
Come on Rina! I can smell PriTickets this way!

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.350
It's the headmistress again!

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:38.520
What's the matter?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:39.680
Uh, well...

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:42.200
PriPara is forbidden for grade schoolers here.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:44.240
Wait, you didn't know?

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:45.170
Yes.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:47.460
Even though you're a student here?

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:48.300
Yes.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.890
I'm so sorry to hear that, Lala.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.720
Don't worry about it, Sophie.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.480
Come on! Go on and get out of here, Lala!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.480
Capisce!

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:00.710
I can smell it!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:04.580
I can certainly smell the remnants of a grade schooler's PriTickets.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.410
Oh, Head Disciplinarian?

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.180
Excuse us.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:15.140
I haven't been so radish in ages!

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:17.410
To have no harvest to show for it is unacceptable!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.700
Oh, there there...

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:25.340
Of course you'd be annoyed too, Rina. Good girl, good girl.

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:33.660
Okay, we're all here-kuma.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.720
Team dance practice is a go-kuma!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.810
Capisce!

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.850
My calculations say...

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.690
Turn at the third beat, with hands at 90°!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.990
And it'll go perfect-pri!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.200
This is practice...

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:53.170
I'm getting nervous...

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:58.760
Not having one of your pickled plums-pri?

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:01.300
I've been trying to have less.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:04.250
I'll have one for the actual show, so it's fine.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.560
Maybe just rest up?

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.130
I'll practice.

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:10.960
Pri pri!

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:11.770
Capisce!

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:12.570
Pri pri!

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:13.480
Capisce!

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.130
Pshu!

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:15.990
Pri pri!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:16.830
Capisce!

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.670
She's actually practicing.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:23.060
And for the first time! With her teammates!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.820
I'll have to do my cosmic best!

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.760
Not hibernatin' time yet-kuma.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:32.930
Yay!

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:34.010
Pshu...

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:36.150
Ah! Sophie!

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:37.230
Lady Sophie!

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:37.990
Chanko!

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:41.160
I'll be fine in a bit. Pshu...

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.230
Really?

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.220
Lady Sophie...

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.210
Chanko?

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.190
I'm fine.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.420
Please, you must rest!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.210
Chanko.

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:51.710
She's really this weak normally?

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:58.100
Decide on a name, and we can call it a day-kuma!

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.810
Have you been thinking-kuma?

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:04.220
Pri! I think PriPri Girls would be good-pri!

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:05.810
That sounds kind of angry.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:09.090
Pri! What's your suggestion then-pri?

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.700
I'd go with... The Red Flash Squad.

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:12.780
Whuh?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:13.730
How wonderful! It's decided then!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:14.860
It's decided-chanko!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.990
Shut it, peanut gallery! What's that make us? A bunch of pickles?

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:18.990
But...

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:22.330
Red Flash Squad!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.960
Might be pretty fun to do.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.940
Oh! That could work-kuma, I see that working-kuma.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:29.690
It's decided!

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:30.810
Chanko!

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.380
Eh?

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.190
Everyone agrees-kuma?

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:35.590
Hold it right there-pri!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:36.130
Red Flash Squad

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:39.990
No way-pri! I refuse to be part of some <i>pickle squad!</i>

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:42.670
You're in such a bad mood today.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:43.460
Red Flash Squad

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:45.600
And whose fault is that?

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.160
Mireille?

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:53.180
How can Sophie and I be so mismatched?

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:56.030
This isn't matching my calculations-pri. We're getting nowhere-pri.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.300
What?

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.590
So...

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.580
What do you think, Mr. Kuma?

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.300
Just your name?

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.660
It looks lonely like that-kuma.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:26.300
Still no good?

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:30.220
I really can't come up with anything.

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:32.710
How about putting your smile...

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:33.520
Huh?

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.510
...in there too.

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:36.510
Like so.

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.870
Wow! So cute!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:41.850
This is great!

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:42.760
No-pri.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:43.280
Eh?

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:46.020
Writing that will be too hard-pri.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:49.820
It'll take too long, and your fans will be left waiting forever-pri.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:53.000
But I really like this one.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.470
I'll learn to do it really fast!

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:59.730
Well... If you think you can, this would make for a great autograph-kuma.

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:03.260
Okay! It's definitely got impact, we'll go with that-kuma!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:06.280
All right! Thank you, Sophie!

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:08.480
Appr            oved

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:13.190
I guess my calculations aren't needed-pri.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.050
Eh?

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.480
You there! Excuse me!

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:19.740
It's about time for your performance to start.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:22.910
Gah! We don't have the name yet-kuma...

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.070
Well, let's just go think about it-kuma!

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:26.370
This is bad!

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:28.830
Mireille?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.610
Come on and think-kuma! Come on, team name!

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:35.290
Come on, team name-kuma! Come on-kuma! Come on-kumargh!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.490
Ow...

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:42.190
Sorry-pri! It's that weirdo bear of ours-pri.

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:46.150
No, it's my fault. I was looking down.

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:47.810
Looking for something-pri?

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.090
Uh, have you seen any lost glasses around here?

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:51.980
Glasses?

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:52.730
These?

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:55.150
Capisce!

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.430
They were right over there. Here you go.

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.480
Thank you!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.030
You really saved me there.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:04.140
Whoa! Sophie, Lala, and Mireille!

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:04.760
Yes.

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:08.160
Pop step gotcha pri!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.620
I'm so glad to meet you!

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:14.960
I became your fan after your new show!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.650
Thank you, Hanana!

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:18.650
Wanna trade Friend Tickets?

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.820
No... I'm too embarrassed.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:24.340
Embarrassed? About what?

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:32.940
Well... I just started coming to PriPara, and am still merely ranked a Sparkling New Student...

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.460
Who would want my Friend Tickets?

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.550
Eh? That's not true!

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:40.030
Huh?

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.760
Right?

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:44.990
Right you are.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:52.150
According to my analysis of 10,000 girls who traded Friend Tickets with someone they met in PriPara,

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:56.510
99 percent were happier after the trade than before.

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:58.380
99 percent...

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:01.590
Amazing! 99 percent!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.740
I really get that.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.590
I still have my first one.

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.760
Even Sophie does?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.230
Wow! It's everyone from the Royal Guard!

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:19.190
You're taking such good care of old ones!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.680
Lady Sophie!

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:21.400
Chanko!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:25.060
I'm so touched! And of course,
we have ours well preserved as well!

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:25.850
Chanko.

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:26.880
Roger!

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.620
Lady Sophie right after her debut.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.600
Adorable!

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:34.500
I haven't seen a photo of her when she was that little before!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.180
The very first ticket traded with Lady Sophie-chanko!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.090
It's my treasure-chanko.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:41.350
Thank you.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.870
You're too kind!

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:44.480
You were all so little.

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:46.330
It was a long time ago.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:52.060
It was a really miraculous encounter for Sophie and the Royal Guard, huh?

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.420
Of course!

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:53.970
Yes.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:59.480
And now it's Hanana and us.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:06.450
Yeah! Let's trade, Hanana!

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:12.160
You three really do make a great team!

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:13.710
Eh?

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:19.120
Lala's positivity, Mireille's analytical ability, and Sophie's sensibility.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:22.310
I'm even more of a fan now!

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.360
That was a nice snappy sound.

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:28.050
Yes.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:31.470
Lala, lala, lala.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.710
I'm sorry-pri.

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:33.440
Eh?

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:40.730
Sophie is who she is because of how long she's been doing this...

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.610
But I keep thinking that I always know best...

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:49.110
No, your analytic ability really is amazing.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.250
Sophie...

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.190
Just treat me like one of you, okay?

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.560
Just say my name normally, guys.

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:57.700
Uh...

00:14:58.520 --> 00:14:59.480
Sophie.

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:00.100
Good.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:03.740
So... Sosososo... Sophie.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:04.730
Good.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:08.600
With the three of us together, we'll definitely, for sure,

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:13.250
with a million times certainty, be way <i>way</i> stronger!

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.560
Million times! Amazing!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:24.820
Well, how about taking the "So" from Sophie, "La" from Lala and "Mi" from Mireille to form the name "SoLaMi"?

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:29.650
And the S from Sophie, M from Mireille and L from Lala...

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:33.160
And with a caring sprinkle of some... Pripripri!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:36.250
I and E to go with those-pri!

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:37.790
And you get SMILE-pri.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:42.280
Wow! Both are good! Both are cute!

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:44.250
So add those up, and!

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:45.820
SoLaMi.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.170
SMILE!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:50.470
Togehter they make SoLaMi SMILE!

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:51.870
"See the sky..."

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.220
"...and smile!" is the feel-pri.

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:58.600
Yeah!

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:01.100
Our team name is:

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.810
SoLaMi SMILE!

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:11.530
Okay, let's get some Red Flash and head to the stage!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.740
Kuma... Kuma?

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.320
Welcome back!

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:17.700
Miss Cosmo-kuma?

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:19.370
What is it-pri?

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.440
Hello.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.770
Sister, why are you here?

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:26.000
I brought something to celebrate the new team.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.960
Here, presents for you.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.290
Pri!

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.170
New Cyalume Coords!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.850
But I really like the old one too...

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.440
I wish I could wear both.

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:40.710
I could remake it so you can use it normally.

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:41.880
All right!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.600
Well, let's go-kuma.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:50.230
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.360
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.530
Coord Change Start!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.880
Pirate Coord, I see.

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:05.370
It's become hugely popular since you wore it for your winning show at the Idol Grand Prix.

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.330
Pirate Coord!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.720
Yes! We can make dream!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:27.200
<i>I really like both Sophie and Mireille!</i>

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.210
<i>I really like SoLaMi SMILE!</i>

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:32.340
<i>Our meeting might really have been a miracle-pri!</i>

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:36.440
<i>SoLaMi SMILE is going to get bigger and bigger-pri!</i>

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.910
<i>I'm really glad I met you.</i>

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.290
<i>My world has just started getting bigger.</i>

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:46.250
The Prism Voice... It's shining!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.560
Making Drama Switch On!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:56.340
Save us! Someone save us!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.840
Save us! Please!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:08.450
Smiling is the key to happiness!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:09.980
Let's Smile-pri!

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:12.010
Liberation Maiden...

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:14.320
Valkyria!

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.030
Lady Sophie!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:17.890
You really are the best!

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:19.820
You're all so cute!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:23.450
This isn't over-usa!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:26.640
Hmph! What's this SoLaMi SMILE junk?

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:31.910
We'll make you regret leaving us out.

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:33.320
Right, Leona?

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:35.090
If you say so, Dorothy...

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:39.540
Cyalume Change!

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:32.280
Lady Sophie! You're positively sparkling!

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:33.650
You're the best-chanko!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:37.860
SoLaMi SMILE, good! So good! Real good! Liftoff-kuma!

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.830
World Go Hall             Japan Branch

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.040
World Go
Championship
Finals

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.980
<i>Wh-What a godlike move...</i>

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:20.990
My loss.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:25.660
He forfeits! It's Toudou Shion's fifth consecutive win of the student championships!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:29.920
And being in seventh grade, she could go for 10 victories in a row.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:32.800
So will you? Will you aim for 10 wins?

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:34.300
I'm finished.

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:35.130
What?

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:40.860
No one coming in the next 10 years could challenge me in go.

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:43.840
So I will retire to go conquer another field.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.050
Eh!?

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:51.250
I must seek a harsher road, one to boil my blood, push my body to its limits, and scorch my heart.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.270
I must go. Farewell.

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:07.600
Oh, it's SoLaMi SMILE! They're so cute!

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:10.410
You can see why they won the Idol Grand Prix!

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.720
They're definitely the next Divine Idols!

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:14.750
For sure!

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.620
<i>Divine Idols?</i>

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:23.610
Idol... This might be worth a try.

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:26.210
Speed is the essence of war!

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:28.690
I'll start by defeating those three!

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.970
Toudou Shion will go to war!

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:11.160
A new beginning! I, Toudou Shion, will conquer the idol world!

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:11.700
However...

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:15.720
Worry not! I will teach you all you need to know-usa!

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:18.870
But only if you can defeat SoLaMi SMILE.

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:21.700
I've seen through their strategy. Victory is mine!

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:24.040
Finally, it's time for Usagi's counterattack-usa!

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:26.250
SoLaMi SMILE is the enemy!

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:28.010
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:23:28.690 --> 00:23:32.290
